  "body": "Hi @all,\r\n\r\ni have a strange problem with my matrix synapse homeserver. I have a room where my Home Automation devices communicate to. I'm using for that the node-red-contrib-matrixbot. It is working as aspected. The devices can send messages to a special matrix room and i receive the messages. \r\nThe problem is only in that room i did receive only silent messages on my iOS devices. That means that i see that there is an message but no notifcation tone or vibration is happening.\r\nWhen i send a direct message to my account from the homebot user, vibration and message tone is there.\r\n\r\nIs there any way to reset the notification settings on a room?\r\n\r\nThanks a lot\r\nRegards\r\nManuel",
